{title: Call It Love}
{artist: Poco}
{key: A}
{duration: 4:00}
{tempo: 104}

{start_of_part: Intro}
[A] [F#m] [D] [A]
{end_of_part}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A] We've got all night, [F#m] let's take our time
[D] Tell me your secrets, I'll tell you mine
[A] When it makes us feel better, call it love [F#m] [D] [A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A] You say you won't, [F#m] I say you will
[D] You make me crazy, but I want you still
[A] When it makes us feel better, call it love [F#m] [D] [A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E] Do we tell the truth [F#m] or do we live a [D] lie?
[E] Is the feeling good, [F#m] is that what makes you [D] cry?
[E] When you say those words, [F#m] look me in the [D] eye [E]
[A] Tell me why you call it love [F#m] [D] [A]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[A] I play my hand, [F#m] you call my bluff
[D] We push each other till we've had enough
[A] When it's all you've got, call it love [F#m] [D] [A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[E] If I didn't have money, [F#m] would you want me [D] still?
[E] When you look real close, [F#m] do we fit the [D] bill?
[E] Call it what you want, [F#m] but only time will [D] tell
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_part: Bridge}
[D] [Bm] [D] [Bm] [D] [E]
{end_of_part}

{start_of_chorus}
[E] Do we tell the truth [F#m] or do we live a [D] lie?
[E] Is the feeling good, [F#m] is that what makes you [D] cry?
[E] When you say those words, [F#m] look me in the [D] eye [E]
[A] Tell me why you call it love
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_part: Outro}
[A] We've got all night, [F#m] let's take our time
[D] Tell me your secrets, I'll tell you mine
[A] When it makes us feel better, call it love [F#m] [D] [A]
[A] Call it love, [F#m] call it love [D] [A]
[A] Call it love, when it's [F#m] all you've got, [D] call it love [A]
{end_of_part}